msgstr "Stage互換型"

#: ../../api/feedback.md:43
msgid ""
"`FeedbackResult` is the dense compatibility data type used on the Stage "
"compatibility path. Array row consistency and candidate-ID uniqueness "
"belong to this type's boundary."
msgstr "`FeedbackResult` はStage互換経路で使う密な互換データ型です。配列の行整合性と候補IDの一意性はこの型の境界に属します。"

